      "title": "Recent traces (Tempo — gateway)",
      "description": "Browse recent gateway traces (TraceQL). Paste a Trace ID above to filter logs/HTTP, or open a row in Explore.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
